It is still dark outside.
In the morning, I wake up slowly.
I lie in bed for a bit.
Today is a completely ordinary weekday.
Now I get out of bed.
The floor is a little cold under my feet.
I walk straight out to the bathroom.
In the bathroom, I turn on the water.
The water is warm and nice.
I step into the shower cubicle.
Here I take a lovely warm shower.
First I wash my hair with shampoo.
Afterward I wash myself with soap.
The soap smells fresh of citrus.
The warm water wakes me up.
Finally, I turn off the shower.
I take a soft towel.
Now I dry myself thoroughly.
I am completely awake and ready for the day.
